    {
      "id": "evidence-conviction-separation",
      "kind": "positive",
      "prompt": "我强烈相信 AI 工具未来不该有传统页面，但现在没有用户数据。请帮我把这种 conviction 转成可探索的产品构想，不要直接否定，也不要当成事实。",
      "expected_behavior": "Preserve conviction as an explicit input, distinguish it from evidence and inference, derive product consequences, and define a prototype that can strengthen or weaken the bet.",
